	"data": "Extract: organize-priority.md\n\nRelevant Passages\n\nProject priority ordering — schedule/task system as prerequisite\n\nI really do think I can't move on from the schedule system. I can't move on from the task system. Those are my highest priorities of the year to come. I would love to start working on my website, but... It's just these are a prerequisite and that's all there is to it. So I'll just keep these on my mind.\n\nRelevance: Establishes an explicit dependency/ordering model for projects — a…",
